  m_Text: "Hi there! Welcome to the motherboard of the Atari Lynx!\n\nPress WASD
    Keys to move,and use the E key to interact with everything - there's something
    to be learnt around every corner!\n\nYou can also use your Mouse Wheel to zoom
    in and out, if you'd like to inspect things more closely!\n\nThere are 6 hidden
    badges in the game, you will be awarded one evry time you learn something new!
    You know you are a Lynx expert when you've got all 6 of them! \n\nI hope you
    enjoy your time here, as much as we enjoy having you here~"
